# The Quickshell lock (remix/lock.qml), password: the account password, then Aurora's Touch ID re-arm (as system-auth
# runs it straight after pam_unix: a password ends a Touch ID lockout / the SEP's password clock; without it a lockout
# outlived the unlock). Not the whole system stack: its pam_fprintd (sufficient, first) would hold a typed password up
# to 30 s whenever the finger context is not up. requisite: a wrong password stops here (never reaches the re-arm).
auth     requisite  pam_unix.so
-auth    optional   pam_aurora_touchid.so
account  required   pam_unix.so
